              {
                "uuid": "dc59d2ab-45fc-4cc5-bc44-4bafce3da77e",
                "control-id": "hipaa-164.312-a-1",
                "description": "The workload's software access is least-privilege: the Lambda role is granted only dynamodb:PutItem on the intake table and s3:PutObject on uploads/* in the uploads bucket, the two calls the handler makes. Policies are authored as aws_iam_policy_document so their actions are reviewable at plan time; any wildcard action, or any policy the gate cannot read before apply, blocks the pull request. Pipeline roles carry an explicit deny on reading PHI from the uploads bucket and submissions table.",
